<title>USA: Mahwah, N.J., approves $3.9 mln school bond ballot.</title>
<headline>Mahwah, N.J., approves $3.9 mln school bond ballot.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voters in Mahwah, N.J., Tuesday approved a $3.9 million school bond referendum by a vote of 1,264 to 616, a Board of Education official said.</p>
<p>The bond proceeds will be used to finance an expansion of Ramapo Ridge Middle School.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
</text>
